{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "d840ed539fe5da96c742be86e6538387e4b86453eccfdc224ecd72dcc094e0c8", "ja": "ううっ……どうしよう……。\nうーん……。", "zh": "呜呜……怎么办呀……\n唔——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1180c1503848af475203203a787a447a00c2c61014e5c1b3bcd369cc5db8c5ad", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。\nどうしました？　なんだか困ってるみたいですけど？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n怎么了？感觉你好像遇到什么麻烦了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "5a286b840e933c8d54465ef6e008068d5cd4bea98e601c280f80f98c97c94464", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さんー！\n助けてください～！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生——！\n请帮帮我～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "4e166b338e10f2de332861222a40e2455dbf9601c2ac840dd849f7e83f7941d1", "ja": "ファンレターが届いたんですけど……\n全部外国語で、ぜんぜん読めないんです～！", "zh": "有粉丝来信寄到了，可是……\n全都是外语，完全看不懂～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1b0d81b23e7f7ce55ac4917e1ba9ac1f6260d105156e1a0586b9757dfb42b08a", "ja": "外国からですか！　どれどれ……うっ。これは俺も\nわからないですね。英語じゃないみたいだけど……？", "zh": "是从国外寄来的吗！我来看看……呃。这个我\n也看不懂呢。好像不是英语……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "549115a425f8bb19a6e09e1dae2895d8fed0dd15aec486155f5fbb3e7d6abb6a", "ja": "あ、でも、ここにイラストがありますよ。\nこの特徴は……。", "zh": "啊，不过这里有插图。\n这个特征是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "5c527d5281853cf9a48adbd7e7a1fe66d4bcab99b64b85965c08c5c9f7ffbad7", "ja": "あっ！　黄色い髪でふたつに結んだ女の子……\nわかりました！　エミリーちゃんのごヒイキ様ですね！", "zh": "啊！金色头发、扎着两个辫子的女孩子……\n我明白了！这是艾米莉小姐的支持者！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "c188770dfc2776d5a70209c5fc699f71f43a718804bb3eb0d6f60c3d75afb4a2", "ja": "ふふっ、このイラストだけでも、\nなんとなく、気持ちが伝わってくる気がします♪", "zh": "呵呵，光是看这幅插画，\n就感觉能隐约感受到其中的心意呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "35ff16c372474c0afcfa991b28f6730dd704c56faed08c7d246f2b00b7117373", "ja": "このお手紙は、エミリーちゃんに届けますね。\n{$P$}さん、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "这封信我会交给艾米莉的。\n{$P$}先生，谢谢您♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "275e648ab092d9f988ca259aee5be92ed70afb792a2bdd6f20666ae2ed5321f3", "ja": "はい、お願いします。\nそれじゃ俺は、事務作業でも……。", "zh": "好的，拜托了。\n那我就去处理些事务工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "5c193b4251d2407744cdfad412c1ede185c8a63c7af2f65046bcf47e4d872cc4", "ja": "あっ、そうでした！　社長さんが、\n{$P$}さんを呼んでましたよ！", "zh": "啊，对了！社长刚才叫您去{$P$}先生了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "b05589a6f6c73213613e82f1a58f102b9ef34ca5641e134f14f02e1a0e1cfd53", "ja": "「ハリーアップ！」って伝えてくれって。\nなんだか、いつもより英語が多かった気がします。", "zh": "让我转达一句“Hurry up！”。\n总觉得英语好像比平时更多了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6891ca5fe42dfe47902b4109605f4191833533ccd90a18bca13571716fa7ef65", "ja": "なぜだろう……。\nとにかく、行ってみます！", "zh": "为什么呢……  \n总之，我先去看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "d47496250141260e2936a8409be036f4026b7d090be8f226be9636f32153ee79", "ja": "はーい♪　いってらっしゃ～い！\n……って、なんていうんだっけ……？", "zh": "好——♪路上小心～！\n……来着？这句话该怎么说来着……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1014_null", "source_sha256": "a643276fac463f5e06ddf29dab1f31b8e2c7f7bb284470f7983baf09f788ee39", "ja": "そして……。", "zh": "接着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "378b96c4b9e7b89ac717712df688965c3784a501673eb885eeae3ced8f0de75a", "ja": "お疲れ様です、音無さん、社長！", "zh": "辛苦了，音无小姐，社长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "5f32da428f54def6b8b2df3b0c419165edf9d158108029f887cb017fd30b346a", "ja": "ヘーイ！　グッドモーニング！", "zh": "嘿！早上好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "df41263ffb9a0bfee834a9d84bd5a96d5963d50429a49f77d10f28dc96cb02ea", "ja": "ノンノンノン。もうお昼過ぎですから、\n「グッドアフターヌーン！」ですよ、社長！", "zh": "不不不。现在已经过了中午，该说“下午好！”了，社长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7d273cfc263d09c88b94bf330417da1075e07b1ac5f83e6b7b7cb037752dc268", "ja": "それで、どうしたんですか？", "zh": "那么，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "591bbc733e1a491fe2a477d3c16552f474641e3d218843753ac81062d59b879d", "ja": "うむ。じつは今、これからはグローバルな視野を持って\n活動範囲を広げていこうと思っていてね？", "zh": "嗯。其实我现在正在考虑，今后要以全球化视野\n去拓展活动范围呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "254ac5228dfa783bf7964e59061b81d8c81e993a8a86ab6cb83fcb53ed18dfe1", "ja": "ふふっ、社長はここのところずーっと、\n海外の音楽雑誌を読んでいたんです。", "zh": "呵呵，社长最近一直在读海外的音乐杂志呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "fd569fa50679cbdb159cab72513ae9afc7bab74e8559222a4a4909c0fe082e19", "ja": "文化に国境はないとはよく言ったものだ。\n最近は、劇場に来る外国人のお客さんも多いだろう？", "zh": "文化无国界这句话说得真好。\n最近剧场里也有很多外国观众吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "94b3282782142d72a179fed9d56f019c3565324d8ea6733315c9a4ae2ae22304", "ja": "そうですね。\n外国からファンレターも届いているぐらいです！", "zh": "是啊。甚至还有从国外寄来的粉丝来信呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "89e534da43d30cbd5363b6fa5b112759b57b8e111e1e2b0bff47d4d9e474f26a", "ja": "そう、今世界中で、日本のアイドルに対する\n関心が高まっているようなのだよ。", "zh": "是的，现在全世界似乎都越来越关注日本偶像了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "8ab101cc0ab63ce4a279e70494e1297d96ee4d2ffafb9ad404866d6abdd647a4", "ja": "そこでだ！　この機会に、我が765プロも\n世界に打って出ようと思っている！", "zh": "所以！我打算趁这个机会，让我们的765事务所也进军世界！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "36ad94fa63db6246449041d6b95988883ca78e5740a66f5408a33ce298079eca", "ja": "というわけで、次の新曲だが……\nニューヨークでレコーディングしてみる気はないかね？", "zh": "所以，关于接下来的新歌……\n有没有兴趣去纽约录制呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "896d6f4d5f5d58fbfe8e4e4ac2f461f0d6cb67f4d47781cc4d91649855c65864", "ja": "ニュ、ニューヨーク！？\nそれは願ってもないことですが……いいんですか？", "zh": "纽、纽约！？  \n这真是求之不得……真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "e1da4f72eded3f6541b6740e8190294570a71487f92cd93d6621fa2c1b913f84", "ja": "いやなに、ちょっとしたツテがあってね。ニューヨーク\nのスタジオに連絡したら、快くOKしてくれたんだ！", "zh": "没什么，只是我有点门路。我联系了纽约的录音室，对方很爽快地答应了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "5ee5f2fd444ebf906a5b116575d0972afa38149b23153c16d39ead476d5ced05", "ja": "すごいですね……！　海外レコーディングなんて、\n貴重な体験……アイドル達にも良い刺激になります！", "zh": "真厉害啊……！居然要去海外录音，这可是难得的体验……对偶像们来说也会是很好的刺激！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "4f09baa46bf72d9e502ef973256abd7d5f4e190579fd87f34f4ccf03e89cfebc", "ja": "そうだろう？\n君も、ニューヨークに行きたいかね～？", "zh": "对吧？\n你也想去纽约吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_1031", "source_sha256": "1c41bb1096eb8b3529cdb27f30f16a9a953bb464047b0bd76c7c8b906544b777", "ja": "行きたい！", "zh": "想去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "7dda200a3af5a59781166111fa335ab9c4d48c5e126b5241ebc938d7ab0a883b", "ja": "行きたいです！\nぜひ、ニューヨークでやらせてください！", "zh": "我想去！请一定让我们在纽约演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "7eba84e5e2b2ca1b4d30850b1fad1188114dc7eefddde6cf6c28498265c74893", "ja": "うむ！　アイドルの人選から何もかも、君に任せよう！\nワールドワイドなサウンドを期待しているよ～！", "zh": "嗯！从偶像的人选到方方面面，就全都交给你了！\n我很期待走向世界的音乐哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_2002_p", "source_sha256": "748ca3f6949e2140da9ddb00cd94b935e9791bfe4c013c46c75af48d02910106", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　頑張ります！", "zh": "谢谢！我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_2003_101kot", "source_sha256": "504d8622aa5e31876929b48e36473705e642a50b67197a0641063d281d34c0eb", "ja": "ふふっ、ニューヨークでレコーディングなんて、\nなんだか大物アーティストみたいですね♪", "zh": "呵呵，在纽约录音什么的，总觉得像是大牌艺人呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_2004_101kot", "source_sha256": "417afd719ae991a4c98819f3791d87534dba1ec71308949b3b1b6475720bb52b", "ja": "爆発事件が起こったり、異星人が襲来したり、恋に\n落ちたりしがちな街ですけど、気を付けてくださいね！", "zh": "虽然是个容易发生爆炸事件、外星人来袭，或者坠入爱河的城市，但请一定要小心哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_2005_p", "source_sha256": "1b6324ea630743f02769d5f89b2785e97eaa0802bc1e64d76968d58f8bdf681e", "ja": "そんな映画みたいなことが……！\nわかりました。無事に帰国できるよう、気をつけます！", "zh": "居然会发生这种电影里的情节……！\n明白了。为了平安回国，我会小心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_intro_2006_p", "source_sha256": "f5840a14fc1e26d5404955b2c8c3ad5dc779140f90df5fdf27d49f8676d2fffb", "ja": "（すぐ曲を手配して、スタジオの予定も確認しないと。\nあっ、飛行機の予約も！　これから忙しくなるぞ！）", "zh": "（得赶紧安排曲子，再确认一下录音室的日程。啊，飞机票也得订！接下来可要忙起来了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
